{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And his head</b> — four instances; and the others: וראשו בשמים (and his head in heaven); וראשו מגיע השמימה (and his head reaches heaven); וראשו לעב יגיע (and his head reaches toward a cloud). Because his head reached as far as heaven, therefore nega'im come upon him, and his head shall be disheveled."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:19.742936050Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}